{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Pan"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"IvorModel"}],"title":"init(plain:)","symbolKind":"init","externalID":"s:9IvorModel3PanV5plainACSgSS_tcfc","roleHeading":"Initializer","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"?("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"plain"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormodel\/pan\/init(plain:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a pan position by parsing its plain string representation,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returning "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if the string cannot be parsed."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"?("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"plain"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The plain string representation of the pan position"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(as produced by "},{"code":"plain","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"plain"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Parsing is lenient. Each angle is a number optionally followed by a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"degree sign and then by a label — ","type":"text"},{"code":"H","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for horizontal or ","type":"text"},{"code":"V","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertical, in either case — with optional whitespace throughout, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the angles may appear in either order. An unlabeled number is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"horizontal angle, and an omitted angle is "},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". For example, "},{"code":"-45H 30V","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"30v -45h","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"-45°H 30°V","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"-45","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"30V","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are all accepted. A string"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that gives either angle more than once, or that contains anything"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"else, is rejected."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Pan\/init(plain:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/Pan/Angle":{"title":"Pan.Angle","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An angle, in degrees, that wraps into the half-open range "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"(-180, 180]"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Angle"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Pan\/Angle","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel\/pan\/angle","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Angle"}]},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/Pan":{"title":"Pan","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A spatial pan position: the direction of a sound in 3-D space relative to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the listener, expressed as a horizontal and a vertical "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Pan\/Angle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in degrees."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Pan"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Pan","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel\/pan","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Pan"}]},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel/Pan/init(plain:)":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel\/pan\/init(plain:)","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"?("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"plain"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"title":"init(plain:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a pan position by parsing its plain string representation,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returning "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if the string cannot be parsed."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Pan\/init(plain:)","type":"topic"},"doc://IvorModel/documentation/IvorModel":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A representation-agnostic musical composition model."}],"title":"IvorModel","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormodel","role":"collection"}}}